# Stock ACK source (rothko): keep what the phone's vendor modules were built against.
# Appended after the Cogan fragments (compat.config, custom.config), so these values win.
# IPV6_SUBTREES adds a member to struct netns_ipv6 inside struct net: it alone changed the
# CRC of 461 of 676 exports in ten core objects (local genksyms check, 2026-10-23), the
# 538-568 "CRC differs" of BakaSU + SUSFS run 12. HZ is compiled into every vendor module
# (msecs_to_jiffies, HZ-based timeouts). The KSUN+SUSFS locked fragment keeps both already.
# CONFIG_IPV6_SUBTREES is not set
# CONFIG_HZ_300 is not set
CONFIG_HZ_250=y
